; Export table for the AutoTarget version.dll proxy.
;
; WoW.exe statically imports a small subset of these (the GetFileVersionInfo
; family) at process start, so naming our DLL version.dll and dropping it next
; to WoW.exe gets us loaded via the normal DLL search order. The full Windows
; version.dll surface is re-exported here so any other code in the process that
; resolves a version.dll function by name continues to work; each export is
; forwarded at runtime by ProxyExports.cpp.
LIBRARY version
EXPORTS
    GetFileVersionInfoA
    GetFileVersionInfoW
    GetFileVersionInfoSizeA
    GetFileVersionInfoSizeW
    GetFileVersionInfoExA
    GetFileVersionInfoExW
    GetFileVersionInfoSizeExA
    GetFileVersionInfoSizeExW
    VerQueryValueA
    VerQueryValueW
    VerFindFileA
    VerFindFileW
    VerInstallFileA
    VerInstallFileW
    VerLanguageNameA
    VerLanguageNameW
